  <summary>&lt;p>Script for snapping windows into zones. Handy when using a (super) ultrawide monitor, an alternative to PowerToys FancyZones and Windows 11 snap layouts.&lt;br />&lt;br />Requires KDE Plasma 6 or higher. If you are running Plasma 5 use &lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/2143914">https://store.kde.org/p/2143914&lt;/a> instead.&lt;br />&lt;br />Please refer to the GitHub page for more info: &lt;a href="https://github.com/gerritdevriese/kzones">https://github.com/gerritdevriese/kzones&lt;/a>&lt;/p></summary>
  <changelog></changelog>
